{
  "set": "delegation_ref",
  "schema_version": "delegation_ref/v1",
  "description": "Content-addressed delegation references over the AlgoVoi substrate (RFC 8785 JCS + integer-millisecond validity bounds). delegation_ref = \"sha256:\" + SHA-256(JCS({delegate_id, delegator_id, not_after_ms, not_before_ms, prev_delegation_ref, scope})). A holder detects tamper offline: positives recompute byte-identical (including reordered envelope keys, which JCS absorbs) and chain via prev_delegation_ref; negatives diverge when scope/expiry/delegate/chain-link is altered, or are rejected when a validity bound is malformed. Contrast: an opaque delegation token (an arbitrary label) does not change when the delegation's content is altered.",
  "canonicalizer": "rfc8785-jcs",
  "delegation_ref_definition": "delegation_ref = \"sha256:\" + hex(SHA-256(JCS({delegate_id, delegator_id, not_after_ms, not_before_ms, prev_delegation_ref, scope})))",
